sequenceDiagram
    %% Sequence Diagram — Facility Change & Partner Warehouse Email Booking

    actor Driver
    participant Service as SetuHaul Service
    actor DestWH as Destination Warehouse
    participant MailJob as PartnerMailRunner (30s)
    participant MailSrv as SMTP / IMAP Server
    actor Partner as Partner Contact

    Driver->>Service: Request move to Facility B
    Service->>Service: facility_change.request_change() (PENDING, TTL 120m)
    DestWH->>Service: POST /v1/warehouse/facility-changes/{id}/approve
    Service->>Service: Move shipments.destination_facility_id + revoke/move pass

    alt Destination is Own Facility
        Service->>Service: after_approval() -> search feasible + 15m auto-hold (follow_up=WAITING)
        Service-->>Driver: "Facility change approved - held slot for 15 min. Reply Yes/No."
        Note over Service: If hold expires unconfirmed, settle() reverts destination_facility_id
    else Destination is Partner Facility (is_partner=1)
        Service->>Service: partner_booking.request_slot() (PENDING_PARTNER, TTL 120m)
        MailJob->>MailSrv: SMTP send [PR-XXXXXXXX] (no driver PII, ask APPROVE/DECLINE)
        MailSrv-->>Partner: Email delivered
        Partner->>MailSrv: Reply "APPROVE" on line 1
        MailJob->>MailSrv: IMAP BODY.PEEK[] search
        MailJob->>Service: partner_booking.handle_reply()
        Service->>Service: Check contact + SPF/DKIM/DMARC + strict bare-word parser
        alt Verified APPROVE & Free Dock
            Service->>Service: BEGIN IMMEDIATE: book APT-PR-... (CONFIRMED), cancel old, APPROVED
            Service-->>Driver: "Partner warehouse approved slot."
        else DECLINE / AMBIGUOUS / Conflict / Expiry
            Service->>Service: Mark DECLINED/FAILED/EXPIRED + escalate, then settle() reverts move
            Service-->>Driver: "Facility change reverted / handed off to operations."
        end
    end
